sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Dashboard as Account Dashboard<br/>(LWC)
    participant Controller as AccountDashboardController<br/>(Apex)
    participant Database as Salesforce<br/>Database
    
    User->>Dashboard: Load Dashboard Page
    Dashboard->>Controller: fetchAccountMetrics()
    Controller->>Database: Query Account records
    Database-->>Controller: Account data
    Controller->>Controller: Calculate metrics<br/>(total, active, avg revenue,<br/>avg health score)
    Controller-->>Dashboard: Metrics data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Display metric cards
    
    Controller->>Database: Query accounts by tier
    Database-->>Controller: Tier distribution data
    Controller-->>Dashboard: Tier chart data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Render tier chart
    
    Controller->>Database: Query accounts by industry
    Database-->>Controller: Industry distribution data
    Controller-->>Dashboard: Industry chart data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Render industry chart
    
    Controller->>Database: Query accounts by type
    Database-->>Controller: Type distribution data
    Controller-->>Dashboard: Type chart data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Render type chart
    
    Controller->>Database: Query all accounts
    Database-->>Controller: Account list
    Controller-->>Dashboard: Account list data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Display account table
    
    User->>Dashboard: Search/Filter accounts
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Filter list by name
    Dashboard->>User: Display filtered results
    
    User->>Dashboard: Click account link
    Dashboard->>User: Navigate to Account record